title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Payment checks: coverage, plan, service
route: /authorizations/eligibility/R-1042
intro: The first three of the seven rows in 'Payment checks', in the side panel 'Verification details' (click 'View full verification details' on the result). Each row has a title, a chip and, when it adds something, one line of fact. If coverage is not found, the other six rows give way to one grey row, 'Nothing else could be checked'. The result page already says eligible, covered and what the service needs.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: 'The service is not covered' has a seeded patient (R-1118, Beacon PPO) and a chip under 'Try a sample' on Verify.
---
start s1 "Result page, side panel opened, section 'Payment checks'"

group gA "Row 1 · Coverage"
  decision a0 "What did the state or plan say about the date of service?"
  process a1 "Title 'Coverage is active on the service date'\nChip 'Active' (green)\n'Ohio Medicaid, active since 01/01/2026, no end date'"
  process a2 "Title 'Coverage is not active on the service date'\nChip 'Lapsed 10/12' (red)\nNo line: the chip says it"
  process a3 "Title 'Coverage is not active on the service date'\nChip 'Ended 09/30' (red)\nNo line: a plan the member moved to is row 2"
  process a5 "Title 'Coverage is active, under another member ID'\nChip 'ID differs' (red)\n'The plan has this member under the ID ending 5521'"
  process a6 "Title 'Coverage could not be checked'\nChip 'Not checked' (grey)\n'Not asked: Verify is paused in Settings'"
  process a4 "Title 'Coverage was not found'\nChip 'Not found' (red)\n'No member matched this ID and date of birth'"
endgroup

process g0 "Rows 2 to 7 are replaced by one grey row\n'Nothing else could be checked', chip 'Not checked'\n'Plan, benefits, authorization, enrollment, limits and other insurance: not asked, no coverage found'"

group gB "Row 2 · The plan"
  decision b0 "Which kind of plan?"
  process b1 "Title 'It is the right plan', chip 'Summit' (green)\n'Managed by Summit Medicaid HMO. Claims go to Summit, not to the state'\nSame source as the facts line: Result › Plan type and routing"
  process b2 "Chip 'Harborview' (green)\n'A Medicare Advantage plan. Claims go to Harborview MA, not to Medicare'"
  process b3 "Chip 'Lakeshore' (green)\n'Behavioral health is carved out to Lakeshore Behavioral. Claims go to Lakeshore, not to the medical plan'"
  process b4 "Chip 'Beacon' (green)\n'Claims go to Beacon PPO'"
  process b5 "Title 'The member is with another plan now'\nChip 'Plan changed' (red)\n'Cardinal Health Plan, since 10/01'"
endgroup

group gC "Row 3 · The service"
  decision c0 "What do the benefits say for this level of care?"
  process c1 "Title 'The service is covered'\nChip 'Covered' (green)\n'Residential 3.5 is payable for substance use disorder (F10.20 on the chart). Codes H0018 and H0019'"
  process c2 "Title 'The service is covered with conditions'\nChip 'Limited' (amber)\n'PHP is payable when the diagnosis is on the plan's list and each day is authorized'"
  process c5 "Title 'The service is not confirmed'\nChip 'Not confirmed' (amber)\n'Harborview answered for coverage, not for PHP. Codes H0035'\nThe verdict is 'Fix before billing'; the result offers 'Ask Caller to confirm the benefit'"
  process c3 "Title 'The service is not covered'\nChip 'Not covered' (red)\n'Residential 3.5 is not a covered benefit under this plan. Codes H0018 and H0019'\nThe verdict is 'Fix before billing'"
  process c4 "Codes by level of care\nResidential 3.5 H0018 and H0019 · IOP H0015 · PHP H0035 · Detox H0010 and H0011"
endgroup

goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Payment checks: authorization to other insurance"

s1 --> a0
a0 -->|Active| a1 --> b0
a0 -->|Lapsed| a2 --> b0
a0 -->|Ended| a3 --> b0
a0 -->|Not found| a4 --> g0
a0 -->|Active, other member ID| a5 --> b0
a0 -->|Verify paused| a6 --> g0
b0 -->|Ohio Medicaid plans| b1 --> c0
b0 -->|Medicare Advantage| b2 --> c0
b0 -->|Behavioral carve-out| b3 --> c0
b0 -->|Commercial| b4 --> c0
b0 -->|The member moved| b5 --> c0
c0 -->|Covered| c1 --> c4
c0 -->|Harborview PHP| c2 --> c4
c0 -->|Not covered| c3 --> c4
c0 -->|Not confirmed| c5 --> c4
c4 --> g1
g0 -.-> g1
